sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client (Browser / REST / App)
    participant Func as Azure Function /api/agent_httptrigger
    participant AI as Azure AI Foundry (AI Project Client)

    Note over Client,AI: Required inputs: message + agentid (threadid optional)

    Client->>+Func: POST /api/agent_httptrigger { message, agentid, threadid? }
    Func->>Func: Validate inputs (message and agentid required)

    alt Missing message or agentid
        Func-->>Client: 400 Bad Request
    end

    Func->>+AI: Get Agent by agentid
    AI-->>-Func: Agent details

    alt Agent not found
        Func-->>Client: 404 Not Found
    end

    alt threadid not provided
        Func->>+AI: Create new Thread
        AI-->>-Func: New thread_id
    else threadid provided
        Note over Func: Use existing thread_id
    end

    Func->>AI: Create Message in Thread (role: user, content: message)
    Func->>+AI: Create and Process Run (thread_id, agent_id)
    AI-->>-Func: Run completed

    Func->>+AI: List Messages in Thread
    AI-->>-Func: Messages list

    Func->>Func: Extract latest assistant reply

    Func-->>-Client: 200 OK { message, threadId }

    Note over Client: Use returned threadId in next request for conversation continuity
